1
00:00:00,841 --> 00:00:02,011
(Raj:)I'm telling you, dude...

2
00:00:02,176 --> 00:00:05,716
(Raj:)...the only way to feel better
about Penny going out with other guys...

3
00:00:05,888 --> 00:00:09,228
(Raj:)...is for you to get back on the whores.

4
00:00:11,394 --> 00:00:13,684
(Howard:)-Horse.
-What?

5
00:00:13,854 --> 00:00:18,024
The phrase is "get back on the horse."
Not whores.

6
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:20,527
(Raj:)That's disgusting, dude.

7
00:00:21,862 --> 00:00:25,072
No, it's not.... Never mind.

8
00:00:25,741 --> 00:00:26,951
(Howard:)He is right, though.

9
00:00:27,118 --> 00:00:30,368
(Howard:)If you want, I can turn you on
to this great new dating site I found.

10
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:31,578
(Leonard:)No, thanks.

11
00:00:31,747 --> 00:00:34,207
(Howard:)You sure? They say
they can find a match for anybody.

12
00:00:34,375 --> 00:00:36,625
(Leonard:)-Have they found a match for you?
-Tons.

13
00:00:36,794 --> 00:00:38,874
(Howard:)I've had, like, eight dates
in the last month.

14
00:00:39,046 --> 00:00:42,046
(Howard:)Twelve, if you count the ones
who showed up and left.

15
00:00:42,716 --> 00:00:45,136
(Sheldon:)-I can't bring the nitrogen tank down.
-Why not?

16
00:00:45,302 --> 00:00:48,552
(Sheldon:)All right, let me restate that.
It's very heavy and I don't want to.

17
00:00:50,057 --> 00:00:52,517
(Leonard:)-I'll help you.
-Thank you.

18
00:00:53,018 --> 00:00:55,558
(Sheldon:)Lift with your knees, not your back.

19
00:00:56,272 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)Good night.

